  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c81d4b4efd64fa4ba77a284cf4062c0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  speachNumber: 0
  speach:
  - Hi!&&Are you crazy?
  - Sorry man...
  - Um, I never actually told you my name earlier, it's Garlic! Like the vegetable.
  - Err, I have to say again that I'm sorry about bumping into you earlier.
  - I wasn't looking, and I was stuck in my thoughts... I hope you're alright.
  - It's not a problem at all! I'm A-OKAY!&&To be honest, I think my ass will have
    a bruise tomorrow...
  - So, what do you do in your spare time?
  - 'Maybe that''s a stupid question, '
  - ut I don't really know what to talk about in this situation...
  - But, do you like arts and crafts?
  - I like to make masks!&&No, I hate arts and crafts, I only lift weights and pick
    up chicks.
  - Um, do you have any childhood friends or anything like that?
  - A few, we are still really close&&A few, but we lost touch
  - 'Sorry if that was a random question, '
  - it's just kind of on my mind tonight.
  - I only really had one childhood friend,
  - I mostly keep to myself.
  - 'It''s just, I ran into him again tonight, '
  - ' for the first time in a long, long time.'
  - The vampire.
  - 'Tell me more!&&I''m sorry to hear that... '
  - Well, I guess there is more to it than that.
  - I sort of idolised him,
  - the way he could hold so much importance in a conversation and easily be seen
    as "cool".
  - As time passed, he got tired of me and my way of life
  - choosing to hang out only with those of a higher social status.
  - I'm sure he had his reasons!&&He sounds like a dick.
  - I tried to copy him in an attempt to keep up with him
  - ' but I dunno'
  - I just tended to embarass myself when I tried.
  - Even these days,
  - ' I still catch myself pretending, trying to fit in.'
